## Repository dependency policy

Classification: {{#if isGroup}}Grouped dependency updates{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'security')}}Security update{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'risk:major')}}Major or pre-1.0 update{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'risk:infrastructure')}}Action, runtime, toolchain, or infrastructure update{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'risk:production')}}Production, peer, or optional dependency update{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'risk:migration')}}Dependency migration or replacement{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'class:lockfile')}}Lockfile maintenance{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'class:routine-dev')}}Routine stable devDependency patch/minor{{else}}Routine dependency update{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}

Merge authority: {{#if (includes labels 'review:human')}}Human merge required after applicable checks and review{{else}}Renovate may merge only after the exact required-check inventory and pristine-branch integrity check pass on the current head{{/if}}

Maturity: {{#if isGroup}}Every grouped update must satisfy its applicable maturity boundary{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'security')}}Immediate PR; the normal age floor is bypassed{{else}}{{#if (includes labels 'class:lockfile')}}No direct release-age claim; verify package-manager supply-chain floors{{else}}Fourteen-day release-age floor where supported{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}

Developer action: Follow the Merge authority line; for Renovate-authorized PRs, none unless checks, pristine-branch integrity, or expected behavior changes; otherwise review the changelog, provenance, affected behavior, and repository-specific proof

AI review: Advisory only; applying a suggestion creates a foreign commit, fails pristine-branch eligibility, and requires a fresh Renovate PR or a separate manual successor

Policy: https://github.com/jasondockery/renovate-config/blob/1.1.0/docs/dependency-merge-policy.md · Local exceptions: https://github.com/{{{repository}}}/blob/{{{baseBranch}}}/renovate.json
